.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-external-registry-set - External private registry credentials


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container external-registry set  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
External private registry credentials

.PP
One private registry per environment (e.g. ghcr.io + a pull-only token). The token is stored encrypted and never returned.

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/containers/{id}/external-registry (operationId typed_put_containers\fBid\fPexternal_registry, scope services_write)


